==Trivia==
*Stardust Street's Japanese name, Hoshikuzu Kaidō (星くず街道, "Stardust Highway"), may be a reference to [[wikipedia:Hunter x Hunter|''Hunter x Hunter'']]'s [[wikia:hunterxhunter:Meteor City|Meteor City]], whose Japanese name, Ryūseigai (流星街), can also be translated as "Falling Star City". Although at first there may appear to be no similarities, if you take out the くず from the stage name, it becomes 星街道, or "Star Highway"; remove the 道 to create 星街, which means "Star City". Finally, add the missing kanji 流 in front and you'll have 流星街, Meteor City/Falling Star City.

